Package: agregR
Authors@R: person("Rafael N.", "Magalhães", email = "rnunesmagalhaes@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
URL: https://rnmag.github.io/agregR/, https://github.com/rnmag/agregR
Title: Bayesian State-Space Aggregation of Brazilian Electoral Polls
Description: A set of dynamic measurement models to estimate latent vote shares
    from noisy polling sources. Features specialized methods for bias adjustment
    based on past performance and correction for asymmetric errors based on
    candidate political alignment.
Version: 1.0.1
